(y) all such matters not specifically mentioned in this subsection as may conduce to the better and more effective carrying out of this Act.

(2) Such regulations may provide that contravention of any specified regulations shall constitute an offence and may prescribe penalties not exceeding a fine of $1,500 for such contraventions.
